(803318, 7488, 6388, '<td valign="top">another diffucult subject to photograph.  I love reflections in windows, but generally I think more subtle ones are more effective.  in this case my eye is struggling to discern between the two, which adds to the creativity given the challenge topic, but detracts from the aesthetic quality of the photo.  DPC voters can accept creativity <i>if</i> the photo also has traditional general appeal.  They don''t like to have to work at figuring things out too much ;)<br/> <br/>see <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=78414" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=78414</a> for my recent attempt at it.<br/> <br/>Good Luck,<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'another diffucult subject to photograph.  I love reflections in windows, but generally I think more subtle ones are more effective.  in this case my eye is struggling to discern between the two, which adds to the creativity given the challenge topic, but detracts from the aesthetic quality of the photo.  DPC voters can accept creativity if the photo also has traditional general appeal.  They don''t like to have to work at figuring things out too much ;) see //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=78414 for my recent attempt at it. Good Luck, Pedro', '2004-07-09 01:09:57.000000', NULL, 0),
