(898381, 7560, 671, '<td valign="top">The illusion was supposed to be the color changes the paint went through.  And since the paint is actually called "Chrome Illusion Chameleon Purple" I thought it fit.  The car wasn''t mine--I saw it parked in a restaurant parking lot, and had never seen the paint before.  It deserves all the criticism it got, but thought I''d show it to you anyway, because I thought it was interesting.</td>', 'The illusion was supposed to be the color changes the paint went through.  And since the paint is actually called "Chrome Illusion Chameleon Purple" I thought it fit.  The car wasn''t mine--I saw it parked in a restaurant parking lot, and had never seen the paint before.  It deserves all the criticism it got, but thought I''d show it to you anyway, because I thought it was interesting.', '2004-09-08 00:14:26.000000', NULL, 0),
