(147339, 7485, 2472, '<td valign="top">I like many things about this shot, but IMHO the absence of the nipple on the left, from the selected angle, makes it look a little bit awkward; and much less important, it hardly meets the challenge. I strongly support fine art pictures of the human body, which I believe to be just as beautiful as any of natures forms, so I''m happy to see this kind of efforts.</td>', 'I like many things about this shot, but IMHO the absence of the nipple on the left, from the selected angle, makes it look a little bit awkward; and much less important, it hardly meets the challenge. I strongly support fine art pictures of the human body, which I believe to be just as beautiful as any of natures forms, so I''m happy to see this kind of efforts.', '2002-10-29 21:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(147340, 7485, 3320, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and the texture. I like the coner. I do not see the illusion that much or I did not expected it in that sense. THe corner of the walls is a little distractind in the upper right corner. Something a little distracting for a ''nude'' is it lookas like there is a mark on the skin like a tee shirt mark. 6 this week, a potential 8 an other week without the wall corners. I like the lines and the fact that only one nipple is visible, it lead the eye along the body line to the upper right corner. Bumping it to 7 even if I am not sure for the illusion. Lionel</td>', 'I like the angle and the texture. I like the coner. I do not see the illusion that much or I did not expected it in that sense. THe corner of the walls is a little distractind in the upper right corner. Something a little distracting for a ''nude'' is it lookas like there is a mark on the skin like a tee shirt mark. 6 this week, a potential 8 an other week without the wall corners. I like the lines and the fact that only one nipple is visible, it lead the eye along the body line to the upper right corner. Bumping it to 7 even if I am not sure for the illusion. Lionel', '2002-10-30 08:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
