(147502, 7514, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good trick!  Very good placement, I know that must have been hard to set up.  I know this is impossible, but the face isn''t solid enough to fully pull this off.  If you don''t mind a suggestion, longer exposure on the face, less w/o as the moon is bright enough to support that change.  7 Swash</td>', 'Good trick!  Very good placement, I know that must have been hard to set up.  I know this is impossible, but the face isn''t solid enough to fully pull this off.  If you don''t mind a suggestion, longer exposure on the face, less w/o as the moon is bright enough to support that change.  7 Swash', '2002-10-28 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
