(147551, 7519, 917, '<td valign="top">Illegal use of jelly! Not fair! Im also docking points for the ugly backdrop and poor composition. You could have used the light passing through the glasses to make it look better. I''d have swapped the top glass with the corkscrew to help balance things up. The corkscrew points out of the frame. The lower glass points to the corkscrew, rather than back at a major compostional element. 7 (good, but I wouldnt put it on the wall)</td>', 'Illegal use of jelly! Not fair! Im also docking points for the ugly backdrop and poor composition. You could have used the light passing through the glasses to make it look better. I''d have swapped the top glass with the corkscrew to help balance things up. The corkscrew points out of the frame. The lower glass points to the corkscrew, rather than back at a major compostional element. 7 (good, but I wouldnt put it on the wall)', '2002-10-28 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
