(147624, 7523, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good trick, is it balanced there or did it have some help?  Very sharp focus.  Don''t mean to be pushing my ideas on you, but a suggestion?  If this is really balanced, try this photo at bench level and prove it, and show all of the top of the can to prove there''s no string holding it up, either.  The best magic leaves less questions to the viewer''s eye.  7 Swash</td>', 'Good trick, is it balanced there or did it have some help?  Very sharp focus.  Don''t mean to be pushing my ideas on you, but a suggestion?  If this is really balanced, try this photo at bench level and prove it, and show all of the top of the can to prove there''s no string holding it up, either.  The best magic leaves less questions to the viewer''s eye.  7 Swash', '2002-10-28 19:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
