(147697, 7529, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well posed, I am assuming your illusion is the gymnast is standing on his feet.  Too bad you couldn''t get someone with long flowing hair (like me!)  Nice touch with the stuffed animal.  If I''m wrong here, could you let me know so I can lower your score?  8 Swash</td>', 'Well posed, I am assuming your illusion is the gymnast is standing on his feet.  Too bad you couldn''t get someone with long flowing hair (like me!)  Nice touch with the stuffed animal.  If I''m wrong here, could you let me know so I can lower your score?  8 Swash', '2002-10-29 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
