(147702, 7529, 2716, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty powerfull thumb.  Cute effect.  The guy should be positioned a bit more to the right to add realism.  6   Jacko.</td>', 'That''s a pretty powerfull thumb.  Cute effect.  The guy should be positioned a bit more to the right to add realism.  6   Jacko.', '2002-10-31 19:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
