(147801, 7542, 3320, '<td valign="top">I like the shot and the idea a lot and the orange colors .... BUT ... the frame is too bright, really even if yuou wanted to focus on it ... and I think the reflections in the window are distracting from the main purpose of the picture. I would be you I would work on it, redo the shot maybe and to my taste you would get a very good picture. 5 as it is, potential 8 to me. I hope this help, I think this is an idea worth to work on again. Bumped it to 6 to encourage you. Lionel</td>', 'I like the shot and the idea a lot and the orange colors .... BUT ... the frame is too bright, really even if yuou wanted to focus on it ... and I think the reflections in the window are distracting from the main purpose of the picture. I would be you I would work on it, redo the shot maybe and to my taste you would get a very good picture. 5 as it is, potential 8 to me. I hope this help, I think this is an idea worth to work on again. Bumped it to 6 to encourage you. Lionel', '2002-10-29 07:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
