(147818, 7544, 472, '<td valign="top">she''s pretty but the extra # of hands and the intense expression has me a bit nervous about asking her for anything : ) .. if this is a long exposure, you could have just had a hidden person extend their hands and use a normal exposure length.  yhen you wouldnt have had the slight blur issues.  just a thought..  mag99</td>', 'she''s pretty but the extra # of hands and the intense expression has me a bit nervous about asking her for anything : ) .. if this is a long exposure, you could have just had a hidden person extend their hands and use a normal exposure length.  yhen you wouldnt have had the slight blur issues.  just a thought..  mag99', '2002-11-01 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(147819, 7544, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is pretty neat!  I definetly get the impression that there are 4 hands.  I think one of the reasons is that your lighting is so effective.  How in the world you managed the light in the center is a mystery.  Good job!  And all those little bubbles?  Looks like this was well thought out and executed.  Congratulations!<br/>The one thing I''d change here is the format.  Portrait (vertical) rather than landscape (horizontal) would work better since the subject is vertical and the top of her  head would  be in the picture.  All in all a good picture.  Good luck!  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'This is pretty neat!  I definetly get the impression that there are 4 hands.  I think one of the reasons is that your lighting is so effective.  How in the world you managed the light in the center is a mystery.  Good job!  And all those little bubbles?  Looks like this was well thought out and executed.  Congratulations!The one thing I''d change here is the format.  Portrait (vertical) rather than landscape (horizontal) would work better since the subject is vertical and the top of her  head would  be in the picture.  All in all a good picture.  Good luck!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-11-03 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(147820, 7545, 4615, '<td valign="top">I think this was for last week''s challenge on lightening, no?</td>', 'I think this was for last week''s challenge on lightening, no?', '2002-10-28 08:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
