(147859, 7554, 2295, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Simple, but appropriate.  I think that I would have flipped this picture upside down, that way the watter would appear to defy gravity.   Focus and lighting are good.  Meets the challenge.  8 waltoml.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Simple, but appropriate.  I think that I would have flipped this picture upside down, that way the watter would appear to defy gravity.   Focus and lighting are good.  Meets the challenge.  8 waltoml.', '2002-10-30 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
