(147861, 7554, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well done illusion!  For kicks, you could have displayed it upside down, so the vase w/water looked as if it were the one on the ceiling.  Very well done!<br/>8 Swash</td>', 'Well done illusion!  For kicks, you could have displayed it upside down, so the vase w/water looked as if it were the one on the ceiling.  Very well done!8 Swash', '2002-10-31 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
