(147863, 7554, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL</td>', 'LOL', '2002-11-02 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(147864, 7554, 1280, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this composition, and also the coloring.  The illusion is clearly visible and thus meets the challenge.  if there would be any changes I''d make, I''d make it a little lighter, with a touch more contrast, and perhaps increase the sharpness.  But it really is acceptable as is.  Good idea, well executed.  Congrats!  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this composition, and also the coloring.  The illusion is clearly visible and thus meets the challenge.  if there would be any changes I''d make, I''d make it a little lighter, with a touch more contrast, and perhaps increase the sharpness.  But it really is acceptable as is.  Good idea, well executed.  Congrats!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-11-03 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
