(148155, 7584, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect shot!  My guess, the globe is on it''s side.  Darn good effect!<br/>9 Swash</td>', 'Very cool effect shot!  My guess, the globe is on it''s side.  Darn good effect!9 Swash', '2002-10-28 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148156, 7584, 2764, '<td valign="top">it loaded finally - groaner of a pun.  can I nit pick?  is the base of the globe straigt? it looks tipped.  I don''t like the sadow of te pea can.  the right of the globe is too light, it would work if the left of the globe were darker.  7</td>', 'it loaded finally - groaner of a pun.  can I nit pick?  is the base of the globe straigt? it looks tipped.  I don''t like the sadow of te pea can.  the right of the globe is too light, it would work if the left of the globe were darker.  7', '2002-10-28 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
