(148158, 7584, 4186, '<td valign="top">world.... peas.... that''s just bad. :D</td>', 'world.... peas.... that''s just bad. :D', '2002-10-29 06:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148159, 7584, 4648, '<td valign="top">I like the pun if it is Peace (peas) in the world.  I also like the picture, especially the light location and the shadows.  I think it is very good.  How''d you do it?</td>', 'I like the pun if it is Peace (peas) in the world.  I also like the picture, especially the light location and the shadows.  I think it is very good.  How''d you do it?', '2002-10-29 22:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148160, 7584, 205, '<td valign="top">i don''t get the pun, the pun is supposed to be whirld peas and world peace not world peas.</td>', 'i don''t get the pun, the pun is supposed to be whirld peas and world peace not world peas.', '2002-10-29 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148161, 7584, 4430, '<td valign="top">peace man!</td>', 'peace man!', '2002-10-30 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148162, 7584, 4210, '<td valign="top">Whirled Peas, right? ;)</td>', 'Whirled Peas, right? ;)', '2002-10-31 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148163, 7584, 1031, '<td valign="top">Someone has finally responded to the famous bumper sticker: "Visualize Whirled Peas!" This is the third entry (so far, including mine) containing the same allusion to a political illusion...I hope I''m sensing a trend...</td>', 'Someone has finally responded to the famous bumper sticker: "Visualize Whirled Peas!" This is the third entry (so far, including mine) containing the same allusion to a political illusion...I hope I''m sensing a trend...', '2002-11-02 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148164, 7584, 472, '<td valign="top">humorous.  : ) good bg darkness. would have pref''d the can to not be cut off. mag99</td>', 'humorous.  : ) good bg darkness. would have pref''d the can to not be cut off. mag99', '2002-11-02 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148165, 7584, 3247, '<td valign="top">I love puns. Quite imaginative.</td>', 'I love puns. Quite imaginative.', '2002-11-02 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148166, 7584, 1826, '<td valign="top">Peas on Earth! Too funny. :) 8 Kaz</td>', 'Peas on Earth! Too funny. :) 8 Kaz', '2002-11-03 07:12:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(148167, 7584, 1280, '<td valign="top">Peace on earth?  Is that what you were going for here?  It took me a minute of studyng it to come to that conclusion.  Proof that taking time to study a picture can be enlightening.  Great concept, thought out and executed.  Technically the lighting is a bit too harsh, resulting in an overexposed portion. A lower wattage, or moving the light source further away would probably be an effective solution.<br/>The black background works very well for contrast.  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious<br/></td>', 'Peace on earth?  Is that what you were going for here?  It took me a minute of studyng it to come to that conclusion.  Proof that taking time to study a picture can be enlightening.  Great concept, thought out and executed.  Technically the lighting is a bit too harsh, resulting in an overexposed portion. A lower wattage, or moving the light source further away would probably be an effective solution.The black background works very well for contrast.  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-11-03 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(148168, 7584, 4177, '<td valign="top">I was thinking "World Peas" when I did this, but a few people came up with "Peas On Earth." That works, too.</td>', 'I was thinking "World Peas" when I did this, but a few people came up with "Peas On Earth." That works, too.', '2002-11-04 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(148169, 7585, 3932, '<td valign="top">Wow... you went through some effort to set this one up!  Very very neat idea though! :)  -   JB</td>', 'Wow... you went through some effort to set this one up!  Very very neat idea though! :)  -   JB', '2002-10-28 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148170, 7585, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, clear image, true colors, good compression.</td>', 'Nice focus, clear image, true colors, good compression.', '2002-10-28 03:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148171, 7585, 3273, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, it made me laugh!  I just hope you were sure that there wasn''t a ''proper'' train coming up behind you!<br/><br/>The viewpoint is good but I wonder if there''s too much sky?  Maybe it should''ve been cropped level with the tops of the trees by the car.</td>', 'I like the idea, it made me laugh!  I just hope you were sure that there wasn''t a ''proper'' train coming up behind you!The viewpoint is good but I wonder if there''s too much sky?  Maybe it should''ve been cropped level with the tops of the trees by the car.', '2002-10-28 06:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148172, 7585, 3859, '<td valign="top">Funny idea!</td>', 'Funny idea!', '2002-10-28 08:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148173, 7585, 3540, '<td valign="top">Too bad you didn''t set up a few more pieces of track to lead out to where it faded away.  Good concept and the picture is pretty well shot too.  Good Luck - Inspzil</td>', 'Too bad you didn''t set up a few more pieces of track to lead out to where it faded away.  Good concept and the picture is pretty well shot too.  Good Luck - Inspzil', '2002-10-28 08:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
