(148441, 7606, 2978, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the comments. Now, for someone who wonder how I made this photo. I printed a piece of paper with diagonal o-line, rolled it up as a tube and attached a piece of curled paper onto one end. Then I photographed it through the tube with flashlight to cast shadow on the background wall. For post-production, I adjust bightness and contrast (it didn''t seem enough) and inverted it.</td>', 'Thank you for all the comments. Now, for someone who wonder how I made this photo. I printed a piece of paper with diagonal o-line, rolled it up as a tube and attached a piece of curled paper onto one end. Then I photographed it through the tube with flashlight to cast shadow on the background wall. For post-production, I adjust bightness and contrast (it didn''t seem enough) and inverted it.', '2002-11-09 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
