(148487, 7613, 3859, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  Had to look real close to figure out this one!  Wish more of the thumb showed, it appears to be detached from the rest of the hand.</td>', 'Very cool!  Had to look real close to figure out this one!  Wish more of the thumb showed, it appears to be detached from the rest of the hand.', '2002-10-29 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
