(148489, 7613, 4648, '<td valign="top">Don''t see an illusion.  See a good, clear photo of a person holding a lit match.  Maybe I''m wrong.  I''ll give you 8 for the photo and take off 4 for no illusion.  If I''m wrong I apologize</td>', 'Don''t see an illusion.  See a good, clear photo of a person holding a lit match.  Maybe I''m wrong.  I''ll give you 8 for the photo and take off 4 for no illusion.  If I''m wrong I apologize', '2002-10-29 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
