(148492, 7613, 2716, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  Not sure how this could be seen as an illusion.  I''ll give you a 7 because I like the composition and the dark back ground. Jacko.</td>', 'Ouch!  Not sure how this could be seen as an illusion.  I''ll give you a 7 because I like the composition and the dark back ground. Jacko.', '2002-10-30 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
