(148494, 7613, 2923, '<td valign="top">It''s ok, i can see the fire behind the finger though, not exactly that good of an illusion.  5 paganini</td>', 'It''s ok, i can see the fire behind the finger though, not exactly that good of an illusion.  5 paganini', '2002-11-01 00:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148495, 7613, 63, '<td valign="top">Great illusion, sorry I missed it when judging.</td>', 'Great illusion, sorry I missed it when judging.', '2002-11-04 01:12:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(148496, 7613, 715, '<td valign="top">I took some time and trials with both the camerasettings and the lights, to make this illusion look as real as possible, but I guess it looked to real huh? But isn''t that the point of an illusion?<br/>Anyhow, thanks for the nice comments and being concerned about my hand. And both apoligizes are accepted :-)<br/><br/>For those who thought it was not an illusion, here''s a way to find out yourself:: Lite a match, grab it firmly, wait till the flame reaches your skin and make a photo without moving :-)</td>', 'I took some time and trials with both the camerasettings and the lights, to make this illusion look as real as possible, but I guess it looked to real huh? But isn''t that the point of an illusion?Anyhow, thanks for the nice comments and being concerned about my hand. And both apoligizes are accepted :-)For those who thought it was not an illusion, here''s a way to find out yourself:: Lite a match, grab it firmly, wait till the flame reaches your skin and make a photo without moving :-)', '2002-11-04 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(148497, 7614, 4798, '<td valign="top">I like this picture.  Too bad it''s slightly out of focus on the glass, with a nice suggestive background...</td>', 'I like this picture.  Too bad it''s slightly out of focus on the glass, with a nice suggestive background...', '2002-10-28 04:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148498, 7614, 4482, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhhhhhh! Refreshing! Great shot! The lighting is superbe! 9</td>', 'Ahhhhhhhhh! Refreshing! Great shot! The lighting is superbe! 9', '2002-10-28 09:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148499, 7614, 3540, '<td valign="top">The lighting for me here just doesn''t do it.  Maybe I''m not seeing it right, but I''m judging the light source used to be on the camera side of these ''mountains'' due to the reflections in the glass.  I think it would''ve been more effective to mute the lights A LOT so that there weren''t quite so many reflections nor any of this intensiity.  Sorry! :(  Good luck anyway - Inspzil</td>', 'The lighting for me here just doesn''t do it.  Maybe I''m not seeing it right, but I''m judging the light source used to be on the camera side of these ''mountains'' due to the reflections in the glass.  I think it would''ve been more effective to mute the lights A LOT so that there weren''t quite so many reflections nor any of this intensiity.  Sorry! :(  Good luck anyway - Inspzil', '2002-10-28 10:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148500, 7614, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good eye!  This does sort of look like mountains.  I esp. like the middle part.<br/>9 Swash</td>', 'Very good eye!  This does sort of look like mountains.  I esp. like the middle part.9 Swash', '2002-10-28 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148501, 7614, 4077, '<td valign="top">Excellent bit of macro work. There''s a bit of distortion on the left hand side that could have done with being cropped-out, but it''s still v.good overall. seasick - 7</td>', 'Excellent bit of macro work. There''s a bit of distortion on the left hand side that could have done with being cropped-out, but it''s still v.good overall. seasick - 7', '2002-10-28 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148502, 7614, 327, '<td valign="top">Very cool, creative work. Nice. Justine</td>', 'Very cool, creative work. Nice. Justine', '2002-10-28 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
