(148510, 7614, 811, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure why, but I really like this picture.  The blurry background makes the front part stand out and I like the colors. karmat</td>', 'I''m not really sure why, but I really like this picture.  The blurry background makes the front part stand out and I like the colors. karmat', '2002-10-30 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148511, 7614, 1687, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2002-10-31 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148512, 7614, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lighting on the ice is just wonderful, really sharp and gives great shape and cragginess. I like the dark ridge behind with the white "moon" peeping over, and the moody out-of-focus blue "sky".<br/>I think the composition is strong. I find my eye initially drawn to the striking "peaks" but is always then pulled gently backwards into the depths of the image.<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'Lighting on the ice is just wonderful, really sharp and gives great shape and cragginess. I like the dark ridge behind with the white "moon" peeping over, and the moody out-of-focus blue "sky".I think the composition is strong. I find my eye initially drawn to the striking "peaks" but is always then pulled gently backwards into the depths of the image.9, Kavey', '2002-10-31 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
