(148525, 7617, 4798, '<td valign="top">Great title! The illusion is well achieved here. Too bad her arms weren''t treated in such a way that they overlap the edge of the ball. On the whole, good picture.</td>', 'Great title! The illusion is well achieved here. Too bad her arms weren''t treated in such a way that they overlap the edge of the ball. On the whole, good picture.', '2002-10-28 04:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148526, 7617, 3746, '<td valign="top">Great shot... getting the two subjects to be in focus must of taken a few attempts.. I like this one.. 8 for now but may up it to 9 once I have voted on the others..</td>', 'Great shot... getting the two subjects to be in focus must of taken a few attempts.. I like this one.. 8 for now but may up it to 9 once I have voted on the others..', '2002-10-28 04:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148527, 7617, 3273, '<td valign="top">It''s not THAT big!   Nice idea well executed.  Maybe it would''ve been better with even lighting across the football (particularly at the bottom) and the ball centered in the frame (it''s slightly off to the left).</td>', 'It''s not THAT big!   Nice idea well executed.  Maybe it would''ve been better with even lighting across the football (particularly at the bottom) and the ball centered in the frame (it''s slightly off to the left).', '2002-10-28 06:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148528, 7617, 3735, '<td valign="top">her hands laying on top of the ball breaks the illusion</td>', 'her hands laying on top of the ball breaks the illusion', '2002-10-28 06:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148529, 7617, 3540, '<td valign="top">I expected to see a ton of this kind of illusion shot this week, but suprisingly it''s been very few.  This was really well done.  You must have a good handle on the aperture setting on your camera.  Great DOF.  That''s what makes or breaks this shot in my mind.  Nice job. - Inspzil</td>', 'I expected to see a ton of this kind of illusion shot this week, but suprisingly it''s been very few.  This was really well done.  You must have a good handle on the aperture setting on your camera.  Great DOF.  That''s what makes or breaks this shot in my mind.  Nice job. - Inspzil', '2002-10-28 09:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(148530, 7617, 4106, '<td valign="top">clever</td>', 'clever', '2002-10-28 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
