(148688, 7625, 2003, '<td valign="top">shot my arm against a white background - used PS to resize the image to lifesize and create 3 overlapping crops - desaturated the 3 new images to 0%, 33% and 66%, printed and taped them up on a black background - cut a hole in my background and in a clean sheet of paper - arranged my hand through the holes and shot about 40 pics before i hid the hole and liked the shadows - thanks to all who like my shot, and a big fat BLEAGH to everyone else!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-01-22 19:20:03.</i></td>', 'shot my arm against a white background - used PS to resize the image to lifesize and create 3 overlapping crops - desaturated the 3 new images to 0%, 33% and 66%, printed and taped them up on a black background - cut a hole in my background and in a clean sheet of paper - arranged my hand through the holes and shot about 40 pics before i hid the hole and liked the shadows - thanks to all who like my shot, and a big fat BLEAGH to everyone else!', '2002-11-04 00:17:00.000000', '2003-01-22 19:20:03.000000', 0),
