(148703, 7627, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!  Too bad the uncolored tree doesn''t show up as well as the colored ones.  Good time exposure work.  Small suggestion:  aim from lower down and look up more at the trees, avoids the city lights and some of the clutter in the background (it might help).  7 Swash</td>', 'Very cool shot!  Too bad the uncolored tree doesn''t show up as well as the colored ones.  Good time exposure work.  Small suggestion:  aim from lower down and look up more at the trees, avoids the city lights and some of the clutter in the background (it might help).  7 Swash', '2002-10-29 19:19:00.000000', NULL, 1);
