(148753, 7634, 772, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to figure this one out.. lol... I can finally see the crayons that are printed and the six that are real... real: jungle green, egg blue, radical red, green/yellow, white, orchid ?  excellent illusion... now.. the lightin could have really punched harder on this photo... do you have white balance settings?  After creating such a great illusion, I would have spent some time working on the lighting to whiten up the background and make these color jump hard :) - setzler</td>', 'It took me a while to figure this one out.. lol... I can finally see the crayons that are printed and the six that are real... real: jungle green, egg blue, radical red, green/yellow, white, orchid ?  excellent illusion... now.. the lightin could have really punched harder on this photo... do you have white balance settings?  After creating such a great illusion, I would have spent some time working on the lighting to whiten up the background and make these color jump hard :) - setzler', '2002-10-29 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
