(148936, 7648, 772, '<td valign="top">though shot to execute here... idea:  i would have held up a piece of colored or dark paper behind this in order to create some extra contrast between the subject and the surroundings... The focus is a bit too soft here also... - setzler</td>', 'though shot to execute here... idea:  i would have held up a piece of colored or dark paper behind this in order to create some extra contrast between the subject and the surroundings... The focus is a bit too soft here also... - setzler', '2002-10-29 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
