(149071, 7662, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful fish doing what he is supposed to - clean the side of the aquariam.  Beautiful placostomus.  I''ve really never look closely at them from this view.  Almost looks like a female with flashy eyes just below the first fin coming in for a kiss.  Know what your illusion is supposed to be - and it is still a good interesting picture.</td>', 'Beautiful fish doing what he is supposed to - clean the side of the aquariam.  Beautiful placostomus.  I''ve really never look closely at them from this view.  Almost looks like a female with flashy eyes just below the first fin coming in for a kiss.  Know what your illusion is supposed to be - and it is still a good interesting picture.', '2002-10-29 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
