(149091, 7668, 1255, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photos in which you realize how it''s done, but you can''t help being drawn to looking at it again and again to see if the missing pieces have returned.  A bit stark colorwise for my taste, but I''m sure it made the illusion more realistic.  shedonist 8</td>', 'This is one of those photos in which you realize how it''s done, but you can''t help being drawn to looking at it again and again to see if the missing pieces have returned.  A bit stark colorwise for my taste, but I''m sure it made the illusion more realistic.  shedonist 8', '2002-11-02 20:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
