(149108, 7669, 1005, '<td valign="top">Ha ha, melons!  All sorts of off color thoughts come to mind, but none of them critique the shot, sorry.  Very good focus, pretty good match with the melons "color", good idea to go Black and White.  Couldn''t you find flesh colored melons?  (joke back at you!)  7 Swash</td>', 'Ha ha, melons!  All sorts of off color thoughts come to mind, but none of them critique the shot, sorry.  Very good focus, pretty good match with the melons "color", good idea to go Black and White.  Couldn''t you find flesh colored melons?  (joke back at you!)  7 Swash', '2002-10-28 19:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(149109, 7669, 4430, '<td valign="top">thank god this doesn''t look as real as the thumbnail.  At first I thought this woman really needed to see a doctor.  Next thought, implants?  But you have some very nice melons that are a wonderful illusion.</td>', 'thank god this doesn''t look as real as the thumbnail.  At first I thought this woman really needed to see a doctor.  Next thought, implants?  But you have some very nice melons that are a wonderful illusion.', '2002-10-28 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
