(149135, 7670, 3942, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but IMHO not very interesting. O.K., the red and green works good together. But the tomato doesn''t look like a flower to me,  the main subject is out of focus and the green plants are not very nice at all...</td>', 'Sorry, but IMHO not very interesting. O.K., the red and green works good together. But the tomato doesn''t look like a flower to me,  the main subject is out of focus and the green plants are not very nice at all...', '2002-10-28 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
