(149186, 7674, 674, '<td valign="top">COMPOSITION -CONTENT  Composition fairly  good gives the viewer the feeling of a Giant, content nice and clean not overly cluttered, although the size restriction gives a rather squashed distortion to this maybe a different crop without seeing the original Iam not sure!<br/>BACKGROUND  Not overly obvious but the sky is a bit washed out.CAMERA WORK -TECHNICAL - Rather to dark a lot of detail is lost in the shadows would have benefitted by some fill in flash might have been better in colour.<br/>DIGITAL PROCESSING - TECHNICAL  It appears to have been slightly oversharpened and could have benefitted from a curves adjustment to brighten it.<br/>My opinion<br/>I like the idea and feel if possible it should be reshot trying to get a better contrast between the light and shadows. I like the facial expression and the humour in this shot!</td>', 'COMPOSITION -CONTENT  Composition fairly  good gives the viewer the feeling of a Giant, content nice and clean not overly cluttered, although the size restriction gives a rather squashed distortion to this maybe a different crop without seeing the original Iam not sure!BACKGROUND  Not overly obvious but the sky is a bit washed out.CAMERA WORK -TECHNICAL - Rather to dark a lot of detail is lost in the shadows would have benefitted by some fill in flash might have been better in colour.DIGITAL PROCESSING - TECHNICAL  It appears to have been slightly oversharpened and could have benefitted from a curves adjustment to brighten it.My opinionI like the idea and feel if possible it should be reshot trying to get a better contrast between the light and shadows. I like the facial expression and the humour in this shot!', '2002-11-25 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(149187, 7676, 3932, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and great subject matter.  I''m sure this wasn''t extremely easy to pull off with the longer exposure, and keeping the board from blowing out.  Technically, I would have liked to the board maybe a  little bit straighter?  The slight tilt is a bit distracting, since it causes the bottom right of the board to be cut out...<br/>-   JB</td>', 'Nice shot and great subject matter.  I''m sure this wasn''t extremely easy to pull off with the longer exposure, and keeping the board from blowing out.  Technically, I would have liked to the board maybe a  little bit straighter?  The slight tilt is a bit distracting, since it causes the bottom right of the board to be cut out...-   JB', '2002-10-28 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
