(149234, 7680, 4077, '<td valign="top">Hmm.. a pity the right-hand image is slightly blurred. Otherwise, this would be an excellent shot. (As it is it''s still pretty good though.) seasick - 7.</td>', 'Hmm.. a pity the right-hand image is slightly blurred. Otherwise, this would be an excellent shot. (As it is it''s still pretty good though.) seasick - 7.', '2002-10-29 04:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(149235, 7680, 3540, '<td valign="top">Well done.  IT was a great idea and the execution was damn good.  I know I couldn''t do any better.  Nice shot - Inspzil</td>', 'Well done.  IT was a great idea and the execution was damn good.  I know I couldn''t do any better.  Nice shot - Inspzil', '2002-10-29 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(149236, 7680, 4049, '<td valign="top">LOL, mirror? You shouldn''t wear shirts like that, it doesn''t go with your look. But I like the idea, so I''ll try not to lower your score cause of your shirt. Just stay out of stripes next time.</td>', 'LOL, mirror? You shouldn''t wear shirts like that, it doesn''t go with your look. But I like the idea, so I''ll try not to lower your score cause of your shirt. Just stay out of stripes next time.', '2002-10-29 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
