(149294, 7683, 1280, '<td valign="top">Interesting!  I don''t know what to say about it.  Well done, it sure looks like sleds on a body, but the body isn''t anatomically correct. Looks like a belly button but in the wrong place.  Good picture.  Well done!   Lighting is good, so is dof, and coloring.   Grayce aka Gracious<br/><br/><br/>Ohhhhhh I just saw it in a different perspective...I get it now!  Duh...Hips and rib cage.  Why I didn''t recognize it before, I don''t know.  Very good job!</td>', 'Interesting!  I don''t know what to say about it.  Well done, it sure looks like sleds on a body, but the body isn''t anatomically correct. Looks like a belly button but in the wrong place.  Good picture.  Well done!   Lighting is good, so is dof, and coloring.   Grayce aka GraciousOhhhhhh I just saw it in a different perspective...I get it now!  Duh...Hips and rib cage.  Why I didn''t recognize it before, I don''t know.  Very good job!', '2002-11-03 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 0),
