(149431, 7696, 2123, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Do you  mean "allusion"?  In that case it would mean to hint or reference without showing the object in question.  Sorry, I think you missed it on this one.  As far as the photo goes, the shadow across the petals is distracting and the focus is on the bottom branch rather than the flower.  Not sure if you meant it that way, but I think it would be more effective if the flower was sharp.  3  kathleenm</td>', 'Hmmm.  Do you  mean "allusion"?  In that case it would mean to hint or reference without showing the object in question.  Sorry, I think you missed it on this one.  As far as the photo goes, the shadow across the petals is distracting and the focus is on the bottom branch rather than the flower.  Not sure if you meant it that way, but I think it would be more effective if the flower was sharp.  3  kathleenm', '2002-10-28 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
