(149488, 7700, 3942, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m wrong, but IMHO this is not more than a photo of someones elses art. Where is your part of creativity? Send me an eMail if I''m wrong and I will look at this a 2nd time to change my vote... - nds<br/><br/>********<br/>Thanks a lot for your eMail and I have to say sorry now! The painting on the wall is your''s and I didn''t saw the illusion with the original stair. I didn''t wanted to offend your sensibilities, but this shot is just too perfect! I looked at it about a few minutes, but I was unable to realize this perfect illusion. Now I understand and I think, you took the right decision with placing more emphasis on the painting than on the original stairs. I hope for your score, that I am the only silly fool among the voters ;-)  Did you thought about a little help for the eye  to see this illusion? Maybe a bunch of flowers, a jag or a basked at one of the stairs could be helpful here. Or possibly just some petals,  well-fitting to the painting...  I hope, that you can forgive my mistake, good luck for the challenge with this awesome illusion! - nds</td>', 'Maybe I''m wrong, but IMHO this is not more than a photo of someones elses art. Where is your part of creativity? Send me an eMail if I''m wrong and I will look at this a 2nd time to change my vote... - nds********Thanks a lot for your eMail and I have to say sorry now! The painting on the wall is your''s and I didn''t saw the illusion with the original stair. I didn''t wanted to offend your sensibilities, but this shot is just too perfect! I looked at it about a few minutes, but I was unable to realize this perfect illusion. Now I understand and I think, you took the right decision with placing more emphasis on the painting than on the original stairs. I hope for your score, that I am the only silly fool among the voters ;-)  Did you thought about a little help for the eye  to see this illusion? Maybe a bunch of flowers, a jag or a basked at one of the stairs could be helpful here. Or possibly just some petals,  well-fitting to the painting...  I hope, that you can forgive my mistake, good luck for the challenge with this awesome illusion! - nds', '2002-10-28 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
