(149508, 7701, 2567, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and a fantastic illusion.  10</td>', 'Clever idea and a fantastic illusion.  10', '2002-10-28 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(149509, 7701, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Very well done.  Good Illusion too, which has been hard to come by this challenge and probably why the entries are down.  Nice lighting and framing. - Good job - Inspzil</td>', 'Excellent.  Very well done.  Good Illusion too, which has been hard to come by this challenge and probably why the entries are down.  Nice lighting and framing. - Good job - Inspzil', '2002-10-28 11:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(149510, 7701, 3111, '<td valign="top">I am looking for a flaw in this one to show how you did this.... I can''t find it.  Too good.  On a technical aspect, I would have liked to see all four corners of the chessboard.  Also, all the story of the picture is off... no chess game could end up like this (knights facing the wrong way, everyone in the corner).  Just a thought - great picture (8) MarkRob</td>', 'I am looking for a flaw in this one to show how you did this.... I can''t find it.  Too good.  On a technical aspect, I would have liked to see all four corners of the chessboard.  Also, all the story of the picture is off... no chess game could end up like this (knights facing the wrong way, everyone in the corner).  Just a thought - great picture (8) MarkRob', '2002-10-28 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(149511, 7701, 4536, '<td valign="top">now that''s an illusion, best one I''ve seen so far.<br/>Those chess pieces look familiar, they''ve seen alot of your camera lately, huh?</td>', 'now that''s an illusion, best one I''ve seen so far.Those chess pieces look familiar, they''ve seen alot of your camera lately, huh?', '2002-10-28 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
