(149526, 7701, 4410, '<td valign="top">At first one thinks there is a mirror and now I see you cut the board on a diagonal and then glued the yellow pieces on top or bottom that is if you flipped the pic upside down ...hold on I''m not sure if this would work....except for two seperate pictures which would explain the lighter blue trim on the yellow side....anyways great work  I give you 10</td>', 'At first one thinks there is a mirror and now I see you cut the board on a diagonal and then glued the yellow pieces on top or bottom that is if you flipped the pic upside down ...hold on I''m not sure if this would work....except for two seperate pictures which would explain the lighter blue trim on the yellow side....anyways great work  I give you 10', '2002-10-28 23:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
