(149554, 7701, 1202, '<td valign="top">My guess, as a frustrated artist ;), is that it''s all done with the color shading at the corners; and, that the ivory colored pieces are layed flat under the upper edge of the chess board. Definitely an optical illusion, and very well thought out and photographed. Congratulations on your well deserved win!</td>', 'My guess, as a frustrated artist ;), is that it''s all done with the color shading at the corners; and, that the ivory colored pieces are layed flat under the upper edge of the chess board. Definitely an optical illusion, and very well thought out and photographed. Congratulations on your well deserved win!', '2002-11-04 01:53:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(149555, 7701, 3900, '<td valign="top">Simply ingenious!  Congrats!</td>', 'Simply ingenious!  Congrats!', '2002-11-04 02:18:00.000000', NULL, 0),
